/-!
# Proof-carrying cofinal representation breaking and existing-Q self-U8

For every requested finite boundary this consumer retains the positive
prefix readout generated from the exact root-installed trace point, a later responsibility-bearing two-path
difference, the exact failure of complete extension, P's ordinary paid next,
the legal P-to-Q occurrence span, and Q's existing rooted U7/self-U8
authority.

It stores no boundary schedule, revised target, action program or third next.
-/

